nt the amount of contracted future revenue that has not yet been recognized, including both deferred revenue related to setup fees and non-cancelable contracted amounts that will be invoiced and recognized as revenue in future periods.</span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span><br/></span></div><div style="text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%">As of June 30, 2026, approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="usd" contextRef="c-4" decimals="-5" name="us-gaap:RevenueRemainingPerformanceObligation" scale="6" id="f-702">4.1</ix:nonFraction> million of transaction price was allocated to the remaining performance obligations. The Company expects to recognize substantially all of this amount as revenue over the remaining contractual terms of the related customer arrangements, which generally range up to four years.</span></div></ix:continuation><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div id="i1e4b886a81f348dfb20716b5afd810a0_43"></div><div style="margin-bottom:10pt"><span id="ia4016d37f73d48b893c5314112c75600"></span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%;text-decoration:underline">5. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="exod:PrepaidExpensesTextBlock" id="f-703" continuedAt="f-703-1" escape="true">Prepaid Expenses</ix:nonNumeric></span></div><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c-1" name="exod:ScheduleOfPrepaidExpensesBreakoutTableTextBlock" id="f-704" escape="true"><ix:continuation id="f-703-1"><div style="margin-bottom:6pt;text-align:justify"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Company prepays certain expenses due to the nature of the service provided or to capture certain discounts. The table below shows a breakout of these prepaid expenses for the periods presented:</span></div><div><ta