Company's Web3 service direct users and business-to-business partnerships decreased $17.8 million for the six months ended June 30, 2026 compared to the same period in 2025. The decrease was primarily driven by a $17.2 million decrease in exchange aggregation revenue from direct users due to lower volume and a $1.3 million decrease in exchange aggregation revenue from business-to-business partnerships, partially offset by a $1.9 million increase in fiat onboarding revenue from direct users due to higher volume and growth in the Company's customer base.</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div id="i1e4b886a81f348dfb20716b5afd810a0_727"></div><div><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The following table summarizes the Company's external revenue by category within our payment processing services:</span></div><div><span><br/></span></div><div><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:48.596%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:11.021%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.406%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:11.021%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.406%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:11.021%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.406%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:11.023%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="9" style="border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2.62pt 1pt 1.5pt 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:700;line-height:114%">Three Months E